# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile is the repository root. Send only what the build needs:
# a smaller context builds faster, and secrets or local state must never reach an image (the image is public).

# Dependencies and build output: installed and built inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# Tests output
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/test-results

# Environment files and keys: never in an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.crt

# Not needed to build the app
.git
.github
docs
infra
**/*.log
CLAUDE.md
apps/web/AGENTS.md
apps/web/CLAUDE.md
